    {
      "id": "seg:paragraph:overview:0008:0001",
      "source": "Use Swift macros that generate additional properties and add protocol conformance for your app intent implementation.",
      "ko": "앱 인텐트 구현에서 추가 속성을 생성하고 프로토콜 준수를 추가하는 Swift 매크로를 사용합니다.",
      "sourceHash": "89ae9f718a492020d200f02f2ad9192b36d239837924066a74daf45bab178f3f",
      "status": "machine_translated"
    },
    {
      "id": "seg:paragraph:overview:0008:0002",
      "source": "The following example shows an app intent that conforms to the `.browser.bookmarkURL` schema:",
      "ko": "다음 예제는 `.browser.bookmarkURL` 스키마를 준수하는 앱 인텐트를 보여 줍니다.",
      "sourceHash": "55c1e82d55a22a35e1e2d657fc0b17569a769517d9695dd7e8e1b510b9202b57",
      "status": "machine_translated"
    },
    {
      "id": "seg:code:overview:0009:0001",
      "source": "```swift\n@AppIntent(schema: .browser.bookmarkURL)\nstruct BookmarkURLIntent: AppIntent {\n    @Parameter\n    var name: String?\n\n    @Parameter\n    var url: URL\n\n    func perform() async throws -> some ReturnsValue<BookmarkEntity> {\n        .result(value: BookmarkEntity())\n    }\n}\n```",
      "ko": "```swift\n@AppIntent(schema: .browser.bookmarkURL)\nstruct BookmarkURLIntent: AppIntent {\n    @Parameter\n    var name: String?\n\n    @Parameter\n    var url: URL\n\n    func perform() async throws -> some ReturnsValue<BookmarkEntity> {\n        .result(value: BookmarkEntity())\n    }\n}\n```",
      "sourceHash": "86118913ccf5cde668999002e9dc3cb3dd06287daef7fb5283b8001c4b867e73",
      "status": "preserved"
    },
    {
      "id": "seg:paragraph:overview:0010:0001",
